{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17107630","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17107630","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1710763001:1":{"text":"왕자님! 역시 계셨군요. 이것 좀 보십쇼, 이게 대체...","source_cn":"殿下！真的是您！您快看，这里是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD146019B558A28EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710763002:0":{"text":"네, 맞습니다. 헛것을 보신 게 아니에요. 여기가 바로, 그 사라졌던 고대의 전당입니다.","source_cn":"我知道。诸位，你们没有看错。这里就是消失的圣古堂。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEC1C8314A47E3BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710763003:1":{"text":"정말 갇힌 건가요...","source_cn":"我们真的被困在……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x004AA02E0A326AFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710763004:0":{"text":"두려워하지 않아도 됩니다. 고대의 전당은 레오프론의 성소이지 않습니까.","source_cn":"无需过度惊慌。圣古堂是耀光的圣所。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CAF6FF8C7F47A91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710763005:0":{"text":"제국을 지킨 영령들이 잠들어 계신 곳입니다. 듀라 여신님의 성스러운 빛의 가호를 받고 있는 곳이기도 하지요.","source_cn":"它的底层，长眠着护国的英烈，它的穹顶，沐浴着艾雅女神的圣光。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66EDAF2B09FFB635","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710763006:0":{"text":"대체 무엇이 저희를 연회장에서 여기로 옮겨왔는지는 모르겠지만...","source_cn":"我不知道是何种伟力，将我们从晚宴上齐聚于此。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x685834C77439BB11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710763007:0":{"text":"레오프론의 기둥인 여러분이 성소에 모인 것은 반드시 뜻이 있을 것이라고 생각합니다.","source_cn":"但我坚信，在此刻，我们——耀光的砥柱——能被选召到这圣...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F168B20A69269D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710763008:0":{"text":"오리안 왕자님 말이 맞습니다. 지금 겁에 질려도 소용이 없지요. 중요한 건 여기서 어떻게 나가냐는 것입니다.","source_cn":"奥利安殿下所言甚是。现在惊慌无用，我们只需要知道，该如...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x835E45D433E64C8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710763009:0":{"text":"네. 그러니 다들 진정하시지요.","source_cn":"没错，现在最重要的是，收起你们的恐惧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DE2063695218127","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1710763010:0":{"text":"저 오리안이 여기 있는 한, 최선을 다해 여러분의 안전을 지킬 것입니다.","source_cn":"只要我奥利安还站在这里，我就会竭尽全力，保护诸位的安全。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9EC62068A49BD39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1710763011:0":{"text":"그 누구도 다치지 않을 것이라고 맹세하지요!","source_cn":"我绝不会让任何人，在我的庇护下出事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8AE990F138E663A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1710763012:0":{"text":"왕자의 목소리가 고대의 전당 안을 메아리치며 내려앉는 순간...","source_cn":"王子的话音刚刚落下，承诺仿佛还在圣古堂内回响之际——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A5C98A96A5B75C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1710763013:1":{"text":" 귀를 찢을 듯 날카로운 굉음이 저 멀리서 갑자기 터져 나왔다!","source_cn":"一阵令人牙酸的尖啸声，从远处猛然传来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4926BC771E2F071C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:男爵葛朗台":{"text":"그랑데트 남작","source":"男爵葛朗台","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奥利安":{"text":"오리안","source":"奥利安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:女公爵梦妮":{"text":"몬니 공작","source":"女公爵梦妮","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:亲王孔蒂":{"text":"콘티 대공","source":"亲王孔蒂","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"나레이션","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":5}}